BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Leathercraft Make a Wallet - May 1 [Tool Library Members]
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260501T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260501T210000
UID:ttl-10955840291009@ttlmarket.com
DESCRIPTION:Make Your Own Leather Project\n\n Join the Toronto Tool Librar
 y team for a fun and educational introduction to DIY tools and their use.\
 n\n 80% Discount for Tool Library Members! $18 only.\n\n (use code at chec
 kout) \n\n Log in to Toronto Tool Library Membership for your discount cod
 e! \n\n \nCurious about leathercraft? In this beginner-friendly workshop\,
  you'll learn the fundamentals of working with leather while completing a 
 simple and satisfying project—perfect for first-timers!\n\n Over the cou
 rse of three hours\, you'll be guided through cutting\, punching\, stitchi
 ng\, and finishing techniques as you create a card holder\, or wallet. All
  tools and materials are provided\, and you'll leave with both a finished 
 piece and the confidence to keep exploring leatherwork with tools from the
  Tool Library!\n\n The full leatherworking kit can be borrowed right now!\
 n\n \n- Awls and Punches\n\n- Snips\n\n- Burnishers\n\n- Dyes and Oils\n\n
  \n Get the tools and the training to get started in leathercraft!\n\n Wan
 t to get notified next time classes are posted? \n\n Join our mailing list
 !
LOCATION:TTLMakerspace\, 192 Spadina Ave.\, Toronto\, ON
URL:https://ttlmarket.com/products/leathercraft-make-a-wallet-may-1-tool-l
 ibrary-members
X-SOURCE:Toronto Tool Library
END:VEVENT
