DESCRIPTION:Join the Toronto Tool Library team for a fun and educational i
 ntroduction to our sewing machines - how to set them up and get started.\n
 \n 80% Discount for Tool Library Members! $18 only.\n\n (use code at check
 out) \n\n Log in to Toronto Tool Library Membership for your discount code
 ! \n\n \n\nFor the absolute beginner that wants to get started. \n\n Want
  to learn the basics of operating a sewing machine? This beginner-oriented
  class will focus on getting comfortable using a sewing machine\, includin
 g winding a bobbin\, threading the machine\, understanding the settings\, 
 and basic machine maintenance. \n   \n In order to put your new skills to
  the test\, we will then cover three different hemming methods\, so that y
 ou can get started on your sewing journey with a practical skill you can b
 ring home to your wardrobe. \n   \n For this class we will be using the S
 inger Heavy Duty \, which can be borrowed from the Tool Library. \n \n Wan
 t to get notified next time classes are posted? \n\n Join our mailing list
 !
LOCATION:TTLMakerspace\, 192 Spadina Ave.\, Toronto\, ON
URL:https://ttlmarket.com/products/sewing-basics-may-12-tool-library-disco
 unt
X-SOURCE:Toronto Tool Library
